OL,3,AReform receives second #36m donation in
OL,4,Atwo days as crypto investor matches
OL,5,Arecord
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Thailand-based entrepreneur said he
OL,8,Fexpected "nothing personally" in return
OL,9,Faside from "a party that is ready for
OL,10,Fgovernment".
OL,12,FReform said the #72m would be used to
OL,13,Fhire "the brightest and best minds to
OL,14,Fwork on policy and the most
OL,15,Fcomprehensive plan for government
OL,16,Fever".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
