OL,3,A'It's like a dog set loose on us' -
OL,4,Afear over Kenya's crackdown on foreign
OL,5,Atraders
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Now they have turned against us," he
OL,8,Ftold the BBC at the Burundian embassy
OL,9,Fin Nairobi where many have been queuing
OL,10,Fthis week for documents to allow them
OL,11,Fto travel back home.
OL,13,F"The threats are many... even from
OL,14,Fchildren," he said, adding: "It's a
OL,15,Flike a dog has been set loose upon us.
OL,16,FWe have been bitten."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
